# BRAVADO: FIREWALKERS let Dice wade into one lava pool a fight (two at the
# second tier): the pool cools to rock. ROCKET DASH: tap B twice and she
# dashes the way she faces, safe, over lava, flattening any monster in the
# way; one tap still drops a bomb. The wiki's reading (B twice) is the
# default; TV Tropes' (fire twice while moving) can be switched on.
game bravado
wait 5
cheat run 1
cheat gear 10 1
cheat fight
cheat empty
cheat nopools
cheat pool 200 94
cheat pool 260 94
expect pools == 2
expect p1_walks == 1
hold RIGHT 35
expect pools == 1
expect p1_walks == 0
expect p1_hp == 6
hold RIGHT 60
expect p1_hp < 6
# the dash
cheat run 1
cheat gear 11 1
cheat fight
cheat empty
cheat nopools
cheat still 0 160 50
cheat still 4 160 40
cheat pool 160 70
press B
press B
expect p1_dash > 0
expect bombs_out == 0
wait 20
expect foes == 0
expect kills == 2
expect p1_hp == 6
expect p1_y < 50
expect p1_dashes == 1
# a single tap is a bomb, a moment later
wait 30
press B
expect bombs_out == 0
wait 16
expect bombs_out == 1
# the other reading: fire twice while moving
cheat run 1
cheat gear 11 1
cheat fight
cheat empty
cheat nopools
cheat dashreading 1
press A
wait 2
press A
expect p1_dashes == 0
wait 30
hold RIGHT
press A
wait 2
press A
release
expect p1_dashes == 1
cheat dashreading 0
